			"Message": "chore(Element): Synchronize 3 submodules for gRPC stability and naming standardization\n\nUpdate the core extension host and backend submodules to address cold-start connectivity issues and enforce strict PascalCase configuration naming.\n\n**Cocoon**: Implement asynchronous polling in the `Service.ts` health check to wait for gRPC channel readiness (up to 3s) before validation. Replace the immediate synchronous state check to prevent false positives during channel transitions (IDLE/CONNECTING) and ensure robust handshake timing with Mountain.\n\n**Mountain**: Standardize WKWebView debug server configuration keys in `Info.plist` and Rust sources from `DEBUG_SERVER` to `DebugServer` and `DebugServerPort` per project naming conventions. Remove the deprecated `DisableUIFixes` key and clear the `Trace` value to reduce release profile noise.\n\n**Output**: Regenerate build artifacts and update the `DisableUIFixes` toggle logic and webview diagnostics logging to align with the latest upstream changes in the `Output` pipeline, ensuring consistent build artifact generation across the extension host.\n\nThese changes stabilize the gRPC bootstrap sequence for the extension host and ensure all native and build configuration keys adhere to the PascalCase standard.",
			"SHA": "12778c510d9a632ccc354825ed4b052401003a68"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-15T19:22:36Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⣿⠁⠀⠀",
				26,
				11
			],
			"Message": "chore(Element): Synchronize 11 core submodules for dependency alignment\n\nUpdate 11 core submodules to align development dependencies and tooling versions across the Land editor ecosystem.\n\n**Cocoon**, **Output**, and **Wind**: Bump `@types/node` from 25.7.0 to 25.8.0 to ensure type definition consistency with the latest Node.js runtime updates.\n\n**Common** and **Echo**: Upgrade `@cloudflare/workers-types` to 4.20260515.1 and `wrangler`/`miniflare` to latest patch versions (4.91.0, 4.20260511.0) to maintain compatibility with Cloudflare Workers runtime features.\n\n**Sky**: Apply minor version updates to `vite` (8.0.12 to 8.0.13) and `astro` (6.3.2 to 6.3.3) for build tool stability.\n\n**Maintain**: Standardize emoji rendering in documentation by replacing raw characters with HTML entities to prevent font fallback issues, and correct Mermaid diagram syntax.\n\n**Mountain**, **Rest**, **SideCar**, and **Worker**: Synchronize repository states to the current branch.\n\nThese updates ensure consistent type safety across the extension host, UI, and build tooling while maintaining alignment with upstream dependency release cycles.",
			"SHA": "6d620dfa74448e4ba2c437eccaa4e1364198da5d"
		},
