				"⣿⣿⠃⠀⠀",
				26,
				12
			],
			"Message": "chore(Element): Synchronize 11 core submodules for diagnostic enhancement and build alignment\n\nExecute a comprehensive synchronization of the Land editor's core submodules to introduce deep runtime diagnostics for extension webviews, enable native debugging tools, and align documentation paths.\n\n**Output**: Introduce three new transform plugins (`InjectWebviewDebugLogging`, `InjectWebviewRuntimeDiagnostics`, `InjectWebviewRuntimeDiagnosticsInner`) to capture lifecycle events, unhandled rejections, and React DOM mutations within extension webviews. Update Content Security Policy to permit dynamic extension execution requirements. Apply global code formatting to build configurations.\n\n**Mountain**: Enable conditional WKWebView inspection in debug builds via the `Inspect` environment variable, allowing external tools to attach to the native UI layer. Reorder Tauri `resources` configuration for logical dependency resolution and fix GitHub documentation links from `blob` to `tree` paths.\n\n**Wind**: Regenerate `CommandCatalog` and `ServiceCatalog` to synchronize with upstream VS Code, reflecting the removal of `workbench.action.chat.openCopilotStatus` (reducing command count to 546) and updated interface definitions.\n\n**Cocoon**: Regenerate build artifacts and `RouteManifest` to capture the latest 118 RPC methods. Apply standard formatting to ESBuild configurations and update OpenTelemetry dependencies to version 0.218.0.\n\n**SideCar**: Patch Node.js binaries to version v22.22.3 across all platforms and sanitize documentation syntax. **Echo**, **Mist**, **Rest**, and **Worker** receive documentation link corrections and formatting standardization to ensure consistent ASCII usage and correct navigation paths.\n\nThese changes provide critical observability for diagnosing silent extension load failures, restore native inspection capabilities for developers, and ensure all component documentation accurately reflects the current repository structure.",
			"SHA": "fd202a404bfcfd391deeb2d3973148c2733292b9"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-14T13:59:38Z",
